            "title": "American Rebel to effect 1-for-25 reverse stock split on March 31",
            "description": "",
            "summary": "American Rebel (AREB) Holdings will effect a reverse stock split of its outstanding shares of common stock, par value $0.001 per share, at a ratio of 1-for-25, to be effective as of 12:00 a.m. Eastern Time on March 31, 2025 as per NASDAQ. The Company\u2019s Common Stock will begin trading on a reverse stock split-adjusted basis at the opening of The Nasdaq Capital Market on Monday, March 31, 2025. Following the reverse stock split, the Common Stock will continue to trade on Nasdaq under the symbol \u201cA",
